{"1908530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raise Your Tribe", "steam_appid": 1908530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>IMPORTANT (I Can’t Promise the Game’s Future and It Is Not a Finished Project) </i></strong><br><i>Development of my game is currently paused. The project has grown too large for me to complete alone, and without funding, I need to focus on my full-time job. I can’t promise when development will continue, but I do not intend to abandon the game, at least for now. This game is very important to me personally.</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>I’m truly sorry for the situation and appreciate your understanding.<strong> </strong></i>ABOUT RAISE YOUR TRIBE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive survival experience that combines looter shooter, horror, survival mechanics, and realistic sim elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly optimized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast open world full of exploration opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story with advanced dialog system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online dedicated PvP server update will be added later, already tested with over 1,000 playtesters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.poster.avif?t=1772626881\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908530/extras/9fcb40ee72a1459b5d92ced3a616cadd.webm?t=1772626881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https